{le la lojban. ku tavla} doesn't work because KU terminates words in  
selma'o LE, which doesn't include {la} -- that's in LA which doesn't  
have a terminator. I believe this is actually why pauses are required  
after cmene, otherwise you wouldn't know when they ended.

See the CLL handy table of terminators at the bottom of this page:

http://lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=179#s17

mu'omi'e .aleks.
